{"id": "EUVD-2026-90257", "enisaUuid": "6799b166-a3d0-3f98-8960-9d071bb231c5", "description": "OpenClaw Windows Node before 2026.7.1 contains an incomplete environment-variable sanitizer in system.run that fails to block GIT_CONFIG_*, DOTNET_STARTUP_HOOKS, and JAVA_TOOL_OPTIONS variables. Attackers with gateway or agent access can supply these variables to allowlisted tools like git, dotnet, or java to load attacker-controlled code and achieve arbitrary code execution.", "datePublished": "2026-09-30T19:16:04", "dateUpdated": "2026-09-30T19:33:24", "baseScore": 7.7, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:P/PR:L/UI:N/VC:H/VI:H/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw-windows-node/security/advisories/GHSA-39cf-qcfw-g8pg", "https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw-windows-node/commit/261ba11aaad671834ad141bb85101b50cf1a38f6", "https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw-windows-node/releases/tag/v2026.7.1", "https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw-windows-node/blob/v0.6.12/src/OpenClaw.Shared/ExecEnvSanitizer.cs#L15-L50", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/openclaw-windows-node-before-2026.7.1-remote-code-execution-via-environment-override"], "aliases": ["GHSA-hf34-gmq4-h679", "CVE-2026-101884"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.47, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "bd733ffa-aeec-3dba-817b-619170b83b3b", "product": {"name": "OpenClaw Windows Node", "vendor": {"name": "OpenClaw"}}, "product_version": "0 <2026.7.1"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "e47928e5-c2bc-35f6-99f3-a1695033c504", "vendor": {"name": "OpenClaw"}}], "isExploited": false}